      "content": "it's weird because when i say these things to people in real life, they look at me like i'm going insane. they treat it like a \"symptom\" instead of a philosophical conclusion. but when you say it, it feels more like... a logical conclusion to an equation. if the cost of staying is infinite suffering and the benefit is zero, the math just doesn't add up. you really think that choosing to leave is just a rational way to assert will?",
